OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's Hospital celebrates
OL,4,A150th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 16 November 1876, news of the
OL,7,Fopening of the institution that would
OL,8,Fbecome Sheffield Children's Hospital
OL,9,Fwas covered in the Sheffield Telegraph.
OL,10,FThe original infirmary was located in
OL,11,FBrookhill and saw 29 in-patient
OL,12,Fadmissions in its first year - a far
OL,13,Fcry from today's 500,000, across a vast
OL,14,Frange of services.
OL,16,FTo mark the NHS hospital's 150th
OL,17,Fanniversary, staff and patients both
OL,18,Fpast and present have reflected on its
OL,19,Fongoing connection to many families in
OL,20,Fthe area.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
